From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{recons|sīganan|lang=gem-pro}}, {{recons|sīhwanan||to strain, drip|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{recons|seyk-||to pour, strain|lang=ine-pro}}.

